699 billion: applying NVIDIA's approximately 70% FY2028 growth outlook to the latest cited FY2027 estimate of $411 billion gives $411 billion × 1.70 = $698.7 billion.\", 'reasons': \"The market reference is centered on the latest analyst estimate of $678 billion, which is rung 2; the reported Morningstar and FactSet estimate of roughly $570 billion is rung 3. NVIDIA's roughly 70% FY2028 growth outlook applied to the latest cited FY2027 analyst estimate of $411 billion implies about $699 billion ($411 billion × 1.70), just below rung 1's $700 billion threshold. Strong customer demand and higher hyperscaler capex tilt the risk upward, but the evidence does not quantify an adjustment that carries the implied figure across that boundary; production capacity and infrastructure delays are also downside constraints.\", 'cites': ['e3396', 'e3397', 'e3471', 'e3541', 'e3658', 'e3659', 'e3660', 'e3872', 'e3873', 'e3874', 'e3939', 'e3980', 'e3993', 'e3994', 'e3995', 'e3996', 'e4043', 'e4064', 'e4135', 'e4156', 'e4157', 'e4158', 'e4204', 'e4245', 'e4289', 'e4290', 'e4339', 'e4342', 'e4348', 'e4349', 'e4499'], 'cites_views': [], 'pushes': [{'evidence_id': 'e3396', 'push': 'toward_last'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3397', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3471', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3475', 'push': 'none'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3541', 'push': 'toward_last'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3631', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3632', 'push': 'none'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3658', 'push': 'toward_last'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3659', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3660', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3841', 'push': 'none'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3872', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3873', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3874', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3939', 'push': 'toward_first'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3980', 'push': 'toward_last'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3993', 'push': 'toward_last'}, {'evidence_id': 'e3994', 'push': 't